  "notes": "Pro Micro style board. Grey Pro Micro pin names (D0, A3, SCK...) placed first in functions. The note 'SHORT ON POWER ON FOR BOOTLOADER' brackets the right-header GND and PROG pins and is recorded on both. The bottom-row corner pads belong to the D9 and D10 positions of the side headers; the five pads between them form the bottom row. RGB LED assignments (GPIO16-18) are internal and skipped.",
